00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:52.220
One of the people that runs this can likes to say that audio quality doesn't matter and

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.740
it's true.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.220
Any recording is better than no recording.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.940
The worst thing is no recording.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:04.460
But the better the audio is, the more appealing it is for people to listen to, and it's more

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.660
pleasant and people will like it better.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.620
If you want to hear bad audio, listen to my first one.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.620
It was pretty bad.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:14.860
